                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d538dc69-2ec6-3958-a21b-d3fbe8b33472",
                        "entry_id": "6a8c0d0f-00e9-3bbe-b9a6-90d51d13e5d2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To go past something; to go too far."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "05b30ce1-a6a5-43eb-86d5-fc912d6f7214",
                                "sense_id": "d538dc69-2ec6-3958-a21b-d3fbe8b33472",
                                "text": "When you drive, you must remember to not overshoot the parking space and end up with two wheels over the line."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2dde98f6-da15-40ad-98af-93081b121237",
                                "sense_id": "d538dc69-2ec6-3958-a21b-d3fbe8b33472",
                                "text": "As a result of the accident at Southend Airport when a Hermes aircraft overshot the runway and fouled the down Shenfield to Southend Victoria line between Rochford and Prittlewell, the Eastern Region is considering warning arrangements, which have already been provided on some lines running past aerodromes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "59c3ef64-7962-4bc7-bc02-e97811241bc9",
                                "sense_id": "d538dc69-2ec6-3958-a21b-d3fbe8b33472",
                                "text": "A ScotRail Driver: […] A good friend of mine overshot two stations back-to-back a couple of years ago. He tried to stop at one station and slid by it. Tried to stop at the next station. He slid by that, too."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8b9e8c62-428a-3b42-8518-1b40f2271893",
                        "entry_id": "6a8c0d0f-00e9-3bbe-b9a6-90d51d13e5d2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To shoot beyond; to shoot too far to hit something."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8e1942a9-24fe-41f9-a954-53c0950f3195",
                                "sense_id": "8b9e8c62-428a-3b42-8518-1b40f2271893",
                                "text": "not to overshoot his game"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c0ecc8ff-6d9f-3e18-9ad1-fe34db480d56",
                        "entry_id": "6a8c0d0f-00e9-3bbe-b9a6-90d51d13e5d2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To pass swiftly over; to fly beyond."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cb3730c1-bf87-30f9-8db7-dcae6b745eff",
                        "entry_id": "6a8c0d0f-00e9-3bbe-b9a6-90d51d13e5d2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To exceed."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "80da9361-d34d-4955-91d8-96b0dd1347bd",
                                "sense_id": "cb3730c1-bf87-30f9-8db7-dcae6b745eff",
                                "text": "to overshoot the truth"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4d319805-f5e6-4f22-8d7e-63998e2b6143",
                                "sense_id": "cb3730c1-bf87-30f9-8db7-dcae6b745eff",
                                "text": "That fire abated that impells rash youth,\nProud of his speed to overshoot the truth,"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d40458f9-f0c0-40e1-bbaa-2ec58467c43c",
                                "sense_id": "cb3730c1-bf87-30f9-8db7-dcae6b745eff",
                                "text": "Measured this way humanity was last at sustainable levels in the 1980s. Now it has overshot by some 20 percent."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "eee9f9d6-2593-4d4a-809a-3f71b85ed11a",
                                "sense_id": "cb3730c1-bf87-30f9-8db7-dcae6b745eff",
                                "text": "The amount a letter overshoots is based on the design, but your eye shouldn’t notice it."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3d66ed32-d854-3069-a260-83ba8e9fe101",
                        "entry_id": "6a8c0d0f-00e9-3bbe-b9a6-90d51d13e5d2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To venture too far; to overreach (oneself)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "reflexive"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e6c4cf50-e55f-33f2-baa8-b282eb84fe22",
                        "entry_id": "6a8c0d0f-00e9-3bbe-b9a6-90d51d13e5d2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To record too much photographic footage."
